---
import { getWateringPlacements } from "../../lib/watering-placement.mjs";
import { getWateringArtwork } from "../../lib/watering-artwork.mjs";
import historySnapshot from "../../../docs/layouts/watering-history-snapshot.json";
import { siteUrl } from "../../lib/routes.mjs";
import "../../styles/tools/watering-map.css";

const placements = await getWateringPlacements();
const artwork = await getWateringArtwork();
---

<section
    class="watering-map card"
    id="watering-map"
    aria-labelledby="watering-map-title"
    data-placements={JSON.stringify(placements)}
    data-history-snapshot={JSON.stringify(historySnapshot)}
    data-artwork={JSON.stringify(artwork)}
>
    <header class="watering-map-heading">
        <div class="watering-map-heading-top">
            <p class="eyebrow">Your watering log, at a glance</p>
            <span class="watering-map-mode">Observation map</span>
        </div>
        <div class="watering-map-title-row">
            <span class="watering-map-emblem" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/water.svg")} alt="" width="36" height="36" />
            </span>
            <h2 id="watering-map-title">Days since watering</h2>
        </div>
        <p>
            Each pot’s place shows the number of calendar days since its last recorded Water event.
            A dated snapshot is available immediately while the live log refreshes. When the live
            log is unavailable, snapshot counts stay fixed at its source-read date. Live data
            refreshes every five minutes while this page is visible. These are observations, not a
            watering schedule.
        </p>
    </header>
    <dl class="watering-map-stats" aria-label="Watering record coverage">
        <div>
            <dt>
                <img
                    class="watering-map-icon"
                    src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/pot.svg")}
                    alt=""
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                />
                Total pots
            </dt>
            <dd>
                <span id="watering-map-total-count">—</span>
            </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt>
                <img
                    class="watering-map-icon"
                    src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/water.svg")}
                    alt=""
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                />
                With Water records
            </dt>
            <dd>
                <span id="watering-map-recorded-count">—</span>
            </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
            <dt>
                <img
                    class="watering-map-icon"
                    src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/history.svg")}
                    alt=""
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                />
                No Water record
            </dt>
            <dd>
                <span id="watering-map-unknown-count">—</span>
            </dd>
        </div>
    </dl>
    <div class="watering-map-actions" aria-label="Watering map controls">
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-refresh" class="watering-map-refresh">
            <img
                class="watering-map-icon"
                src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/refresh.svg")}
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
            />
            <span id="watering-map-refresh-label">Refresh data</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-png" disabled>
            <img
                class="watering-map-icon"
                src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/download.svg")}
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
            />
            Download PNG
        </button>
        <button type="button" id="watering-map-svg" disabled>
            <img
                class="watering-map-icon"
                src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/download.svg")}
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
            />
            Download SVG
        </button>
        <button
            type="button"
            id="watering-map-enlarge"
            class="watering-map-enlarge"
            aria-pressed="false"
        >
            <img
                class="watering-map-icon"
                src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/expand.svg")}
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
            />
            <span id="watering-map-enlarge-label">Enlarge image</span>
        </button>
    </div>
    <p id="watering-map-source" class="watering-map-source" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        Loading published watering observations…
    </p>
    <p
        id="watering-map-export-status"
        class="watering-map-export-status"
        role="status"
        aria-live="polite"
    ></p>
    <figure class="watering-map-figure">
        <div
            class="watering-map-viewport"
            tabindex="0"
            role="region"
            aria-label="Watering placement image; enlarge to scroll horizontally"
        >
            <div id="watering-map-image" class="watering-map-image" hidden></div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>
            The layout follows the photos supplied October 22, with front and rear tables shown
            separately. The owner confirmed the pale rear rosette as Arctic Ice (#11 / P37) on
            October 23. Other locations and unconfirmed placements appear in their own group. A
            logged move is listed in the details; free-text locations cannot update diagram
            coordinates. “Unknown” means no active Water event was recorded. The full map fits your
            screen; use Enlarge image for a closer view with sideways scrolling, or open the
            readable pot details below. The default map is a searchable SVG: use your browser’s Find
            command (Ctrl+F) to locate plant names and IDs. Portraits are collection artwork, not
            evidence of the current pot or identification. P31 / #7 and P32 / #8 are on the kitchen
            window shelf under the reported 54 W six-head LED bars and 10 W three-head LED. P39 /
            #13 and P40 / #14 are planned for the shelf next to the terrarium after repotting; the
            map retains their current quarantine location until that move happens.
        </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <details class="watering-map-details" id="watering-map-details">
        <summary>
            <img
                class="watering-map-icon"
                src={siteUrl("assets/ui-icons/list.svg")}
                alt=""
                width="20"
                height="20"
            />
            Watering and placement details for every pot
        </summary>
        <ul id="watering-map-pot-list" aria-label="Watering details by pot"></ul>
    </details>
    <noscript>
        Enable JavaScript to load the watering log and generate a downloadable image.
    </noscript>
</section>
<script>
    import "../../client/tools/watering-map.js";
</script>
